934,10935,10936,10937,10938,10939,10940,10941,10942,10943,10944,10945,10946,10947]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhugerong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060","text":"抗字幼節，孫策外孫也。遜卒時，年二十，拜建武校尉，領遜眾五千人，送葬東還，詣都謝恩，孫權以楊竺所白遜二十事問抗，禁絕賓客，中使臨詰，抗無所顧問，事事條答，權意漸解。赤烏九年，遷立節中郎將，與諸葛恪換屯柴桑。抗臨去，皆更繕完城圍，葺其牆屋，居廬桑果，不得妄敗。恪入屯，儼然若新。而恪柴桑故屯，頗有毀壞，深以為慚。太元元年，就都治病。病差當還。權涕泣與別，謂曰：「吾前聽用讒言，與汝父大義不篤，以此負汝。前後所問，一焚滅之，莫令人見也。」建興元年，拜奮威將軍。太平二年，魏將諸葛誕舉壽春降，拜抗為柴桑督，赴壽春，破魏牙門將偏將軍，遷征北將軍。永安二年，拜鎮軍將軍，都督西陵，自關羽至白帝。三年，假節。孫皓即位，加鎮軍大將軍，領益州牧。建衡二年，左大司馬施績卒，拜抗都督信陵、西陵、夷道、樂鄉、公安諸軍事，治樂鄉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"抗","kind":"person","person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"幼節","kind":"person","person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孫策","kind":"person","person_id":"e9c_070_567","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line060:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"楊竺","kind":"person","person_id":"xg3_juy_uxc","status":"contextual_provisional","interp